Package: parkeze-rak-power
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: lua, lua-libmodbus, lua-cjson, libubox-lua, kmod-usb-serial-ch341
Source: parkeze
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The RAK7289CV2's power board: its watchdog and battery pack.
 Feeds the power board's hardware watchdog, which on the newer RAK7289CV2
 revision cuts DC power ten minutes after the last feed, and reads the RAK
 battery pack when one is fitted, over Modbus RTU on the CH340 inside the
 Pro. Reports both to parkeze.net. RAK-specific; only on boards that declare
 the power board.
